{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"\"Secel! Are you here!\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T06:31:54.509000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880338752541712384","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"With no noise, the Giant Owl glides low above The Village. With a whisper, the talons let go, and she drops into a stream. Pulling herself from the water, the Tiefling begins making her way through the place, and eventually spots a Redcoat carrying a box. Sneaking up behind the man, she pulls him into an alleyway. The hilt of the mace putting pressure on the windpipe of the British soldier eventually cracked the man's neck, and his body slumps to the ground. Then she laid in wait until another Redcoat walked out, before casting the sound of an owl hooting. \n\n\"Who goes there?\" The Redcoat shouts as he draws his sword. \"In the name of the King-\" **CRUNCH!!** The man's skull became a sandwich, with one slice of bread the wall and the other a mace. Secel then moves to the other side of the river, nodding to the Giant Owl. Looking into Marv's establishment, she calls out. \"The King is dead! Fuck the King!\" \n\nThe three remaining Redcoats turn, two raising their rifles and firing as the third's sword exits the sheath. \"Death to traitors!\" The one with the sword screams as she charges out. Then the Owl strikes, picking the woman up with a tortured scream as she is flung down the way.\n\n\"I'm here!\" She calls out as she moves, but lets out a scream of pain as one of the shots lands it's mark.","created_at":"2021-08-26T06:33:47.555000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880339226690977862","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"Johnathan Smashes the other two with his flail, screaming a war cry \"I'm here Secel!\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T06:35:58.165000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880339774509043722","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"She lets out a breath and rushes over to him, jumping up to envelop him in a hug. Then an \"Ow ow ow! Why did i do that?\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T06:37:31.830000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880340167368523776","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
