{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"\"I love you two, I'm sorry I was gone for so long, I'm sorry I wasn't there for you, I promise from today onwards I will be there for you for the rest of my life\" Johnathan will fall to one knee \"I have never know anyone as splendid as you, as determined as you, nor as strong. And I know that for the rest of my life I will never find anyone else like you. Secel, I love you not only from the bottom of my heart, but from the very air I breathe and the light that enters my eyes. You are my reason to fight, my strength in battle, and my home in peace. You are my moon and stars in the night sky, and my sun in day. Will you do me the honor of marrying me?\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T06:49:09.435000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880343093335973909","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850785753365872641","content":"Her heart begins beating faster as she kisses him again. \"Yes! Yes! A thousand times yes!\" She then provides aid to Marv and grabs Johnathan, pulling him outside. \"I have a lot to tell you my love, but first,\" She clings tightly to him. \"brace yourself.\" Then, in the view of the half-orc, the Giant Owl swoops down, talons opening to pick him up.","created_at":"2021-08-26T06:53:52.922000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-26T06:54:14.793000Z","id":"880344282366627901","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
